Some status is kept and counters updated; e.g. if you kill a troll
and leave the level, then return after 50+ turns the troll might get
resurrected anyway.

Anyway, leaving a level is a standard means to heal yourself. You may
remember one proposal for visiting the mines if you are not prepared;
stay on the upstairs of the first mine level, try to kill what comes,
retreat upstairs to heal, return if you feel better. There are a few
problems with that, though; returning means that the monster(s) will
get the first hit on you, and if you escape the level you should keep
in mind that some monsters will follow you.

